# =============================================================================
# .gitignore  --  code-companion repository for the FreshRetailNet-50K paper
# =============================================================================
# Policy: this repository ships ONLY the code needed to reproduce the results.
# Manuscripts, LaTeX sources/artifacts, generated outputs, datasets, notebook
# render artifacts, and local-only scripts are intentionally excluded.
#
# Strategy: ALLOWLIST. We ignore everything at the top level, then explicitly
# un-ignore the files and directories that belong in the public companion.
# (A trailing global section re-ignores caches even inside kept directories.)
# =============================================================================

# ---- 1. Ignore everything at the repository root --------------------------
/*

# ---- 2. Un-ignore the replication code & documentation --------------------
# Top-level entry points
!/pipeline_leakfree.py
!/benchmark_comparison.py

# Environment / project config
!/requirements.txt
!/requirements-lock.txt
!/requirements-frn-baseline.txt
!/requirements-frn-baseline-py312.txt
!/pytest.ini

# Repository meta
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/CITATION.cff

# Source packages and experiments (contents kept; see section 4 for exclusions)
!/src
!/scripts
!/tests
!/docs
!/notebooks
!/results

# =============================================================================
# 3. Datasets are NEVER committed (see README "Data" -- fetch from source)
# =============================================================================
data/
*.parquet
*.csv.gz
*.feather

# =============================================================================
# 4. Paper-serving and non-final files excluded from the otherwise-kept
#    scripts/, tests/, and docs/. Only experiment and business-value code
#    ships; anything whose sole job is producing the manuscript does not.
# =============================================================================
# notebook-maintenance utility
scripts/fix_notebooks*.py
# Local finalization wrappers remain excluded, but the public replication
# package includes the table/figure builders cited by the manuscript.
scripts/run_full_*.sh
scripts/finalize_*.sh
# test that gates manuscript-table drift (needs the paper artifacts)
tests/test_paper_csv_sync.py
# Local manuscript-process write-ups
docs/*CHANGELOG.md
docs/claim_evidence_map.md

# Manuscripts, submission correspondence, and publication bundles
research/
reviews/
submission/
submissions/
paper_source/
paper_source.zip
paper.pdf
report.pdf
response_letter.pdf
*.tex
*.bib
*.cls
*.bst
*.sty
*.pdf
*.zip

# =============================================================================
# 5. Global junk -- ignored even inside the kept directories above
# =============================================================================
# Python caches / build
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Notebook render outputs (figures/CSVs are regenerated by scripts/)
notebook_output/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
